d to the film's tension and drama.\n\nthe performances in the film are also excellent, with jesse eisenberg delivering a standout performance as mark zuckerberg. andrew garfield is also excellent as eduardo, bringing a sense of vulnerability and desperation to the role.\n\noverall, the social network is a gripping and thought-provoking film that explores the complexities of the facebook era. it's a must-see for anyone interested in the history of the company and its impact on modern society.\n\nrating: 9/10\n\nnote: this film is rated r for language, some drug use and a scene of sexual content.", "logprobs": [{"token": "the", "logprob": -0.045232724}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -0.0016868184}, {"token": " network", "logprob": -7.6293654e-06}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.18040486}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.00012385078}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.32515162}, {"token": "201", "logprob": -2.9086643e-05}, {"token": "0", "logprob": -3.933899e-06}, {"token": " american", "logprob": -0.3342006}, {"token": " bi", "logprob": -0.0031711787}, {"token": "ographical", "logprob": -0.00043990472}, {"token": " drama", "logprob": -0.011117537}, {"token": " film", "logprob": -0.00057299406}, {"token": " directed", "logprob": -0.18416922}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.0021900972}, {"token": " david", "logprob": -0.009290322}, {"token": " fin", "logprob": -0.00041380903}, {"token": "cher", "logprob": -2.682173e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.2697384}, {"token": " written", "logprob": -0.0017886845}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -3.0994368e-06}, {"token": " alex", "logprob": -1.8568808}, {"token": "is", "logprob": -2.1721315}, {"token": " b", "logprob": -0.012464952}, {"token": "led", "logprob": -0.10465769}, {"token": "el", "logprob": -4.5299425e-06}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.73313475}, {"token": " j", "logprob": -1.3065292}, {"token": "esse", "logprob": -0.07415617}, {"token": " e", "logprob": -0.47771692}, {"token": "isen", "logprob": -0.0034244962}, {"tok